{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794565063226,"sessionID":"ses_e2b9697f2ffeiRFWI5QsKkZXLt","part":{"partID":"prt_1d469c051001M1osWy86yQUbYp","sessionID":"ses_e2b9697f2ffeiRFWI5QsKkZXLt","messageID":"msg_1d469b0e8001ttsVDHUpX4dFBS","type":"tool","id":"call_2bdefc42eb7d45f28f5c660e","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"grep -n \"^- \\[ \\] T018 \" specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/015-health-default-and-brief-refinements/tasks.md"},"output":"101:- [ ] T018 [P] Mark a local-scorer answer as degraded in its metrics (`FB`). In `resultFromCliData`, add `...(degraded ? { degraded: true } : {})` as the last field of `metrics`. Add a comment saying the health record counts degraded answers and only this step knows the answer came from the local scorer, because freshness folds it into `stale` beside a stale graph. Verify: `TC` exits 0 and `V tests/hooks/skill-advisor-cli-fallback-envelope.vitest.ts tests/hooks/skill-advisor-cli-fallback-no-match.vitest.ts` reports 0 failed.\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"101:- [ ] T018 [P] Mark a local-scorer answer as degraded in its metrics (`FB`). In `resultFromCliData`, add `...(degraded ? { degraded: true } : {})` as the last field of `metrics`. Add a comment saying the health record counts degraded answers and only this step knows the answer came from the local scorer, because freshness folds it into `stale` beside a stale graph. Verify: `TC` exits 0 and `V tests/hooks/skill-advisor-cli-fallback-envelope.vitest.ts tests/hooks/skill-advisor-cli-fallback-no-match.vitest.ts` reports 0 failed.\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"grep -n \\\"^- \\\\[ \\\\] T018 \\\" specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/015-health-default-and-brief-refinements/tasks.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794565